OTOGAKURE — ORIENTATION NOTICE
For every operative entering Lord Orochimaru's service

LOYALTY IS EVERYTHING

You have been chosen. Understand what that means.

In the Hidden Sound, strength is the only currency and loyalty is the only law. Lord
Orochimaru raised this village from nothing to serve his work. Your worth is measured by
your usefulness to that work, and by nothing else.

What is expected of you
- Obey without hesitation. An order from Lord Orochimaru or his Head Medic is absolute.
- Keep the village's secrets with your life. What you see in these halls dies with you.
- Give your body to the cause. You may be asked to bear the seal, to undergo modification,
  or to serve the research directly. This is not cruelty. It is purpose.
- Do not mistake Lord Orochimaru's investment in you for sentiment. He values what is
  useful. Remain useful.

A warning
Those who fail, who betray, or who outlive their usefulness are not mourned. There is no
retirement from the Sound — only service, and its end. Serve well, and you will be given
power beyond what any village would offer you.

Welcome to the Sound. Prove yourself worthy of it.
